    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“What couldn’t stand the light was never going to last anyway.”</em></p><p><strong>Cleansing Breath (1/Soma Break).</strong> As an action, exhale a 15-foot cone of radiant fire. Each creature in the cone makes an Intrigue check vs. your Resolve, taking <strong>2d10 exploding sephirotic damage (flavor: holy fire)</strong> on a failure, or half on a success. The damage scales with your character tier: 3d10 at Tier 2, 4d10 at Tier 3, 5d10 at Tier 4.</p>",
